EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm all right.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} No need to worry!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Things will work out somehow.
They always do!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Anyway,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I'm still happy{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I got to see
you one last time before I left{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}THAT in itself is good fortune,
don't you think?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'm leaving town,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} but {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
will still be the same great place.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I hope you still visit everyone else!

